{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >J.A.R.E.D is an atmospheric adventure platformer set in a mysterious underground facility. Your goal is to help broken Computers reach the repair points.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a labyrinth of forgotten machinery, dynamic puzzles, and perilous platforms as you take care of helpless fragile Computers. Be careful not to break them, as they will also help you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge tests  your reasoning and platforming skills, with upgrades that evolve your abilities. The deeper the mystery, the stronger you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome many obstacles throughout 40 levels, in 4 different worlds as you descend deeper into the facility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help fragile, broken Computers reach safety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new abilities along the way which will help you reach your goal</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997060?t=1760549257","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997060/06880d188d8c9ef7d57c20cb1a1e0765d3207e99/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760549257","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997060/73fcc3746a87a79a43e8ca9de770a71da9626c43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760549257","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997060/73fcc3746a87a79a43e8ca9de770a71da9626c43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760549257","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":